# Response headers of the site on Netlify (and Cloudflare Pages, which reads the same file).
# The embedded YouTube player needs the site in the Referer of its requests, or it stops with
# "Error 153: Video player configuration error". strict-origin-when-cross-origin sends only the
# origin of the site (https://example.org/), never the page.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
